    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Glór Na Mara is situated in an enviable location close to all the fantastic amenities Ardmore Village has to offer. Homes in this development will be just a short stroll from the breathtaking Ardmore Beach and scenic cliff walk, making it a truly idyllic lifestyle location.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Ardmore, a charming seaside village renowned for its rich history and vibrant community, residents will enjoy easy access to the renowned Ardmore Blue Flag Beach, Ardmore Cliff Walk, while Ardmore’s picture postcard Main St is a 2 minute stroll along with a daily bus services to Dungarvan, Youghal, Waterford and Cork.\r\n\r\nSports enthusiasts will benefit from nearby facilities, including Ardmore GAA Club, Soccer Club, Sea Kayaking, Surfing, Snorkeling, Stand Up Paddle Boarding and many more sporting pursuits.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent educational options with the much acclaimed St. Declan’s Ardmore National School and a daily bus service to renowned secondary schools in both Dungarvan & Youghal.\r\n\r\nThis residential site is in an enviable location close to all the fantastic amenities Ardmore Village has to offer. Homes in this development will be just a short stroll from the breathtaking Ardmore Beach and scenic cliff walk, making it a truly idyllic lifestyle location.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Ardmore, a charming seaside village renowned for its rich history and vibrant community, residents will enjoy easy access to the renowned Ardmore Blue Flag Beach, Ardmore Cliff Walk, while Ardmore’s picture postcard Main St is a 2 minute stroll along with a daily bus services to Dungarvan, Youghal, Waterford and Cork. This prime location also provides convenient access to the N25 Waterford-Cork route, ensuring seamless connectivity for commuters.\r\n\r\nLOCAL ATTRACTIONS\r\n\r\nArdmore Beach, Goat Island & Whiting Bay Beach, Curragh Beach & Ballyquin Beach\r\nArdmore Cliff Walk\r\nSt. Declan’s Monastery & Round Tower\r\nCliff House Hotel & Restaurant\r\nRenowned White Horse’s Restaurant\r\nThe Round Tower Hotel & Restaurant\r\nArdmore Open Farm & Mini Zoo\r\nArdmore Adventures (Watersports)\r\nThe Hot Tub Hut, Ballyquin\r\nSoul Sea Sauna\r\nArdmore Farmers Market\r\n\r\n\r\nFEATURES & SPECIFICATIONS\r\n\r\nA Rated Home\r\nBuilt to nZEB Compliance\r\nTiled Roof\r\nPVC Future Proof Windows\r\nPVC Fascia, Soffits & Downpipes\r\nEco Joists at first floor level\r\nBrick & plaster finish to front elevations\r\nDoors, Skirting & Architraves\r\nAir to Water Heat Pump & Pressurised System\r\nMechanical Extract Ventilation System\r\nNatural Planting (Seeded Lawn - front and rear)\r\nFitted Kitchen/ Fitted Wardrobes\r\nHigh Spec High U Value Windows and Doors\r\nSanitary Ware\r\nInternal walls, ceilings & woodwork painted\r\nCobble lock Driveway for 2 vehicles\r\nCharging point provision for electric car\r\nElectrical Specification\r\nInsulation to floors, walls and roof space to A rated specification\r\nWired for TV in Living Room and master bedroom\r\nSmoke Alarm fitted\r\nTen Year Structural Guarantee /Homebond\r\nBack boundary wall blockwork\r\nNeighbouring boundary - concrete post and timber panels\r\nFootpaths surrounding the home\r\nElligible for the Help to Buy Scheme"
      },
      {
